                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 10,
                            "last_played": 1514096192
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game should have been released to Early Access and then fixed and repaired and finished.  Currently the game is incomplete, buggy, crashes, and has very little in the way of help, information, or even tooltips.  This is about as early an Alpha as you can get and still call it a release.   Not very fun.  There are so many great games in this genre now that to release this incomplete hodgepodge town builder features and call it \"finished\" is a bit disingenuous.  No idea if this game will get to a reasonable release state but it isn't there now and there isn't enough status information in the game to even let me know how I'm doing.  I'm baffled that they didn't go Early Access with this.\n\nDo not buy, this needs more time in the oven.",
